{"hw":"ἀντιγράφω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀντιγράφω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀντιγράφ-ω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">write against</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">in answer, write back,</b> <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.129</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ir.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.86</span> </span> W., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Luc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.Chr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.18</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PFlor.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">278ii 30</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τῆ γραφῇ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">vie in description</b> with painting, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Longus</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prooem.</cite> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, with <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.154</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45.45</span> </span>), as law-term, <b class=\"lex-tr\">put in as an</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀντιγραφή,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">plead against,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τι περί τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Is.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.17</span> </span>, cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">48.31</span> </span>; also <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τινί,</span> c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">plead against</b> another <b class=\"lex-tr\">that</b> such is the case, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.5</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">44.39</span> </span>:—also, <b class=\"lex-tr\">bring a counter-accusation,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Poll.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.58</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.119</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">154</span> </span>; later in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">plead in answer to</b> a charge, <span class=\"gk\">-γράψαι ὡς οὐκ ἔπραξεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.75</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">keep a counter-reckoning</b> of money paid or received (cf. <span class=\"gk\">ἀντιγραφεύς</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ath.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">54.3</span> </span>; simply, <b class=\"lex-tr\">check</b> accounts, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PTeb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">89.13</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">issue a rescript</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">888.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀντιγραφῆναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be copied,</b> <span class=\"gk\">εἰς στήλας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Milet.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.148.93</span> </span>.</div></div>"}